---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our Services"
  description="A seamless, fully managed interior design service in six stages, from plan review and concept design to procurement, execution and styling.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-14 pt-20 text-center lg:pb-20 lg:pt-28">
    <p class="eyebrow text-brown">Our Services</p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-5xl font-light leading-[1.05] lg:text-7xl">From first sketch<br><em>to finishing touch</em></h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">A seamless, fully managed interior design experience, guided by six carefully considered stages.</p>
  </section>

  <nav class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20 lg:px-10" aria-label="Service stages">
    <ol class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-px border border-ink/10 bg-ink/10 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6">
        <li class="bg-stone"><a href="#stage-1" class="block h-full p-5 text-center transition hover:bg-taupe/30"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-brown">01</span><span class="mt-2 block text-[0.65rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em]">Plan Review &amp; Concept Vision</span></a></li>
        <li class="bg-stone"><a href="#stage-2" class="block h-full p-5 text-center transition hover:bg-taupe/30"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-brown">02</span><span class="mt-2 block text-[0.65rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em]">Concept Design</span></a></li>
        <li class="bg-stone"><a href="#stage-3" class="block h-full p-5 text-center transition hover:bg-taupe/30"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-brown">03</span><span class="mt-2 block text-[0.65rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em]">Procurement</span></a></li>
        <li class="bg-stone"><a href="#stage-4" class="block h-full p-5 text-center transition hover:bg-taupe/30"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-brown">04</span><span class="mt-2 block text-[0.65rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em]">Detailed Design Drawings</span></a></li>
        <li class="bg-stone"><a href="#stage-5" class="block h-full p-5 text-center transition hover:bg-taupe/30"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-brown">05</span><span class="mt-2 block text-[0.65rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em]">Execution</span></a></li>
        <li class="bg-stone"><a href="#stage-6" class="block h-full p-5 text-center transition hover:bg-taupe/30"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-brown">06</span><span class="mt-2 block text-[0.65rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em]">Setup &amp; Styling</span></a></li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <section id="stage-1" class="scroll-mt-6">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="photo min-h-[360px] lg:min-h-[600px] " style="--img:url('/images/service-1.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:px-20 ">
        <p class="eyebrow text-brown">Stage 01</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">Plan Review &amp; Concept Vision</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl italic text-brown">Understanding your space. Defining your vision.</p>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          <p class="text-lg text-ink">Every exceptional interior begins with a thoughtfully considered plan.</p>
          <p>We begin by reviewing existing architectural drawings and floor plans, carefully assessing spatial layouts, room proportions, circulation and functionality. Where appropriate, we recommend refinements to optimise the use of space, enhance natural light and ensure the layout complements your lifestyle.</p>
          <p>Alongside this, we take the time to understand your individual tastes, aspirations and practical requirements.</p>
          <p>Through initial consultations, inspiration imagery and carefully curated mood boards, we establish a clear creative direction, laying the foundations for a beautifully cohesive design.</p>
          <p>Our aim is to ensure that every space is thoughtfully planned, both aesthetically and practically, before progressing to the design stage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="stage-2" class="scroll-mt-6 bg-taupe/30">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="photo min-h-[360px] lg:min-h-[600px] lg:order-2" style="--img:url('/images/service-2.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:px-20 lg:order-1">
        <p class="eyebrow text-brown">Stage 02</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">Concept Design</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl italic text-brown">Bringing ideas to life.</p>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          <p class="text-lg text-ink">With a clear vision established, we begin transforming ideas into beautifully considered design concepts.</p>
          <p>This stage explores the creative elements that will define your interiors, from colour palettes, materials and finishes to furniture, lighting and bespoke joinery.</p>
          <p>Through detailed spatial planning and realistic 3D visualisations, we allow you to experience your proposed interiors before work begins.</p>
          <p>Every element is thoughtfully selected to create a cohesive design that reflects your individual style.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="stage-3" class="scroll-mt-6">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="photo min-h-[360px] lg:min-h-[600px] " style="--img:url('/images/service-3.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:px-20 ">
        <p class="eyebrow text-brown">Stage 03</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">Procurement</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl italic text-brown">Curating every detail.</p>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          <p class="text-lg text-ink">Beautiful interiors are defined by the quality and consideration of their individual elements.</p>
          <p>We carefully source and specify furniture, lighting, fabrics, finishes and decorative accessories, drawing upon our network of trusted suppliers, artisans and specialist manufacturers.</p>
          <p>Our procurement service includes product selection, sourcing and obtaining quotations, ensuring each element aligns with the overall design vision and project budget.</p>
          <p>From statement pieces to the smallest finishing details, every selection is made with purpose.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="stage-4" class="scroll-mt-6 bg-taupe/30">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="photo min-h-[360px] lg:min-h-[600px] lg:order-2" style="--img:url('/images/service-4.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:px-20 lg:order-1">
        <p class="eyebrow text-brown">Stage 04</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">Detailed Design Drawings</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl italic text-brown">Where creativity meets precision.</p>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          <p class="text-lg text-ink">Translating a design concept into reality requires meticulous technical planning.</p>
          <p>We prepare comprehensive detailed design drawings and specifications to communicate the design intent clearly to contractors, tradespeople and specialist suppliers.</p>
          <p>These may include detailed floor plans, lighting and electrical layouts, bespoke joinery drawings, bathroom elevations and material specifications.</p>
          <p>Our attention to technical detail ensures that the creative vision is supported by practical solutions, allowing the project to progress with clarity and precision.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="stage-5" class="scroll-mt-6">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="photo min-h-[360px] lg:min-h-[600px] " style="--img:url('/images/service-5.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:px-20 ">
        <p class="eyebrow text-brown">Stage 05</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">Execution</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl italic text-brown">Bringing the vision to reality.</p>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          <p class="text-lg text-ink">With the design finalised, we oversee its transformation from drawings into beautifully realised spaces.</p>
          <p>Working closely with contractors, craftsmen and specialist suppliers, we provide ongoing design coordination and project oversight to ensure the original vision is faithfully executed.</p>
          <p>From reviewing finishes and resolving design details to monitoring progress and maintaining quality, we remain involved throughout the installation process.</p>
          <p>Our aim is to make the journey as smooth and enjoyable as possible, ensuring every element comes together beautifully.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="stage-6" class="scroll-mt-6 bg-taupe/30">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="photo min-h-[360px] lg:min-h-[600px] lg:order-2" style="--img:url('/images/service-6.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:px-20 lg:order-1">
        <p class="eyebrow text-brown">Stage 06</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">Setup &amp; Styling</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl italic text-brown">The art of the finishing touch.</p>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          <p class="text-lg text-ink">The final stage is where a beautifully designed space truly comes to life.</p>
          <p>We carefully coordinate the placement of furniture, artwork, lighting and accessories, thoughtfully styling each room to create a harmonious and welcoming environment.</p>
          <p>From perfectly layered textiles to carefully curated decorative pieces, we believe it is the smallest details that make the greatest difference.</p>
          <p>The result is a beautifully finished interior that feels effortless, personal and ready to be enjoyed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
